# Under the app's minimum (640x480, X-MinSize): an older launcher ignores X-MinSize, so the shared runner shows the
# "needs 640x480" notice instead of the app, which closes on any key; a portrait canvas under X-Portrait (480x640) gets it too.
title RSS Reader: screens under 640x480
env RSSREADER_DATA /tmp/rss-reader-scene-data
sizes 480x320 640x400 480x560

shot notice
expect noquit
key down
expect quit
